----
== YAML Turned 25 This Year

* YAML implementations in over 50 languages
  * https://yaml.org/libraries/

* Used almost everywhere you look
  * Kubernetes, Docker, Ansible, CI, configuration
  * Nearly 80% of active GitHub repos have a YAML file

----
== YAML has Problems

* The YAML spec is huge
  * Is it possible to change the spec now?
  * It would take years to implement in every language

* Many implementations are stil YAML 1.1
  * Latest 1.2 spec is from 2009 (2021 update).

* No popular implementations are fully spec compliant
  * https://play.yaml.com/?show=gdhflLnJPpxHUrsS#OiBmb28=
  * YAML Family hand-me-down bugs

* No two implementations are fully compatible
  * Lots of edge cases
  * But good enough for production!?

----
== YAML is Still being Developed

* YAML is a versioned language: `%YAML 2.0`

* YAML Ecosystem Tools (XML Roots)
  * YAMLScript - Code in YAML - YAML as Code
  * YAMLSchema - Powerful Schema Lang for YAML
  * YAMLStar - One YAML for Every Language

* Plugins are the path forward
  * YAML core team has 80+ ideas for YAML
  * We can test them out with plugins in 1.2
  * ~12 plugin APIs are currently planned

* A New YAML Specification is "Coming Soon"…
  * With implementations in 50+ languages!

